@startuml
title Component Diagram — DalaSu

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "«actor»\nFarmer / Agronomist" as Farmer #F5F5F5
rectangle "«actor»\nResearcher" as Researcher #F5F5F5

package "DalaSu" {
  component "User Interface\nKZ/RU localization [optional FR-13]" as UI
  component "Application Service\nfield [FR-09] · journal [optional FR-10]\nalerts and season view [optional FR-11–FR-12]" as App

  component "Irrigation Calculation Core [FR-05–FR-08]\nFAO-56 · Kc · Dr · fallback" as Core
  component "ML Research Pipeline [FR-01–FR-04, optional FR-14]\nRF · XGBoost · hybrid residual correction\ntime-aware CV · evaluation · SHAP" as ML

  component "Data Gateway\nvalidation · daily aggregation · source adapters" as Gateway
  database "Operational Data\nfields · crops · irrigation log" as OperationalData
  folder "Research Artifacts\ndatasets · models · metrics" as Artifacts
}

cloud "Environmental Sources\nOpen-Meteo · Sentinel-2 · SoilGrids" as Sources
cloud "AmeriFlux US-Ne2" as AmeriFlux
cloud "Push Provider" as Push

Farmer --> UI : Uses application
Researcher --> UI : Runs experiments
UI ..> App : Requests

App ..> Core : Calculate recommendation
App ..> ML : Train / compare models
App ..> OperationalData : Manage field data
App ..> Push : Send alert

Core ..> Gateway : Weather, NDVI and soil
Core ..> OperationalData : Field and irrigation history
Core ..> Artifacts : Approved model

ML ..> Gateway : Training and validation data
ML ..> Artifacts : Models, RMSE/R² and SHAP

Gateway ..> Sources
Gateway ..> AmeriFlux

note bottom of Artifacts
  Technology-neutral architecture.
  Fixed seed; test data excluded from tuning.
  FR-15 is outside the current release.
end note

@enduml
